   "id": 0,
   "en": "{07 0f 00}{01 00 00 14 00}Sigh{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 0a 00} It's so depressing, I\nreally don't want to talk\nabout it tonight.",
   "et": "{07 0f 00}{01 00 00 14 00}Ohh{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 0a 00} See on nii masendav,\net ma ei taha sellest\ntäna õhtul rääkida."
  },
  {
   "id": 1,
   "en": "{07 0f 00}{01 00 00 14 00}{0b 03 00}{04 02 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 14 00}{07 16 00} I'm begging\nyou to just stay away.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}\nSee, sadness is contagious.\n{07 08 00}If you get too close to me,{01 00 00 0a 00}\nyou'll catch it! And that\nwould be.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}a real downer.",
   "et": "{07 0f 00}{01 00 00 14 00}{0b 03 00}{04 02 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 14 00}{07 16 00} Ma palun sind,\nhoia lihtsalt eemale{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}\nNäed, kurbus on nakkav.\n{07 08 00}Kui tuled liiga lähedale,{01 00 00 0a 00}\nsaad selle külge! Ja see\noleks{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}tõeline nadi lugu."
  },
  {
   "id": 2,
   "en": "{07 0f 00}{01 00 00 14 00}Everything just stinks{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 14 00}\nSorry. {01 00 00 0a 00}I get really sad when\nI'm hungry, {01 00 00 0a 00}{04 02 00}.",
   "et": "{07 0f 00}{01 00 00 14 00}Kõik on lihtsalt jube{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 14 00}\nVabandust. {01 00 00 0a 00}Lähen kurvaks,\nkui kõht on tühi, {01 00 00 0a 00}{04 02 00}."
  },
  {
   "id": 3,
   "en": "{07 0f 00}{01 00 00 05 00}I'm sorry, {04 00 00},{01 00 00 0a 00} but\nseeing you right now isn't\ncheering me up at all.",
   "et": "{07 0f 00}{01 00 00 05 00}Vabandust, {04 00 00},{01 00 00 0a 00} aga\nsinu nägemine ei tee mu\ntuju praegu üldse paremaks."
  },
  {
   "id": 4,
   "en": "{ff 00 00 04}{07 04 00}{01 00 00 0a 00}Phewww{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 01 00}{ff 00 00 00}\n{07 0f 00}{01 00 00 14 00}It's{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}too{01 00 00 14 00} heartbreaking!\nAnd I'm just starving{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 0a 00}\n{07 08 00}I just can't even talk about\nwhat happened right now,{01 00 00 0a 00}\n{04 02 00}!",
   "et": "{ff 00 00 04}{07 04 00}{01 00 00 0a 00}Uhhh{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 01 00}{ff 00 00 00}\n{07 0f 00}{01 00 00 14 00}See on{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}liiga{01 00 00 14 00} valus!\nJa mul on kõht tühi{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 0a 00}\n{07 08 00}Ma ei suuda praegu isegi\nrääkida sellest, mis juhtus,{01 00 00 0a 00}\n{04 02 00}!"
